# ── separate repository ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# uranodyne is its own repo: different audience, release cadence and
# dependency set. The citable artifact is the format kernel + spec +
# validator + corpus, and it should not drag the science stack behind it.
uranodyne/

# ── data products, not source ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1.4 GB of derived products lives here. None of it is source, and none of it
# belongs in git history — once written, a large blob is permanent.
M27/
demo_output/
skyview_cache/
*.h5
*.zarr/

# Stray .fita/.fits at the repo root are scratch output from development runs.
# The conformance corpus is the deliberate exception: it is generated by a
# script, small, and tracked, because it is evidence rather than output.
*.fita
*.fits
!corpus/**/*.fita
!corpus/**/*.fits

# ── build / packaging ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so

# ── tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.venv/
venv/

# ── editor / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
